  "steps": [
    {
      "heading": "Roast the sprouts",
      "blocks": [
        "Heat the oven to 220°C / 200°C fan / gas mark 7. Trim and halve the sprouts. Toss on a baking tray with {{neutral-oil}} oil and season. Roast for 20 minutes.",
        "Add the walnuts, rosemary sprigs, {{chilli-flakes}} crushed chillies and {{honey}} honey. Toss and roast for 5–6 minutes more, until golden and crisp."
